      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Hey there, I'm trying to both understand the issue here and the proposed solution. Seems particularly focused on only Chinese character sets? (potentially Japanese as well depending on what they use).\n\nIf that's the case, isn't using the specific type of parenthesis you need within your translations enough for your use case without impacting the same source that other languages are using?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
